{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlJTIwQmFsbGFkJTIwT2YlMjBDYWJsZSUyMEhvZ3VlJTIwJTI4MTk3MCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Ballad Of Cable Hogue","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bEth8XAYaytjzxnHkLkj4nZx2XD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4WfwZ5QLbyQccaaTDsJLs1Mt3By.jpg","description":"Double-crossed and left without water in the desert, Cable Hogue is saved when he finds a spring. It is in just the right spot for a much needed rest stop on the local stagecoach line, and Hogue uses this to his advantage. He builds a house and makes money off the stagecoach passengers. Hildy, a prostitute from the nearest town, moves in with him. Hogue has everything going his way until the advent of the automobile ends the era of the stagecoach.","releaseInfo":"1970","genres":["Comedy","Western","Action","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.0","runtime":"121 min","cast":["Jason Robards","Stella Stevens","Slim Pickens","David Warner","L.Q. Jones","Strother Martin","R.G. Armstrong","Peter Whitney"],"director":["Sam Peckinpah"],"released":"1970-03-18T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Cable Hogue says … “Do unto others … as you would have others do unto you.”","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jason Robards","character":"Cable Hogue","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9y0HAtWWBkB02gVzh8QDdz6UYZH.jpg"},{"name":"Stella Stevens","character":"Hildy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qtAO54E8URyIKbzpDj3DjX7U9qE.jpg"},{"name":"Slim Pickens","character":"Ben Fairchild","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8UwvsZe0frSzCoyC8KGSfjAaZBf.jpg"},{"name":"David Warner","character":"Joshua","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AlsZcAY2c4chfOxMW69gHQzH1B2.jpg"},{"name":"L.Q. Jones","character":"Taggart","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vSGLFloekrgC8eIaqxCiKe7VW0u.jpg"},{"name":"Strother Martin","character":"Bowen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mHJudNvMY5eoFpDZmr3Xa2rqU93.jpg"},{"name":"R.G.